 dict(d="2g",k="short",m=2,q="The first sheet was so thin in one corner that daylight shone through “like a window”. What does this comparison show, and why is it effective?",a="It shows the paper was very thin and see-through; a window is clear, so the reader can picture the thin patch.",g="1 mark for the paper being very thin / see-through. 1 mark for explaining the effect of comparing it to a window."),
